===About===
Get2gether aims to offer a good competition that boosts activity, proving grounds for the interested, as well as an opportunity to get together with old or new teammates. 

With liberal rules (like, any map can be played if both agree), we hope to see some good and fun games!

==Format==
* '''Group phase''' (BO3)
** Round robin groups of 4, all teams play eachother.
** Top 2 in each group goes into Gold Bracket.
** Bottom 2 in each group goes into Silver Bracket.
** Teams on equal points will be separated by: 1) direct confrontation, 2) most frags.

* '''Bracket phase''' (BO5) 
** Single elemination bracket.
** Third place deciders will be played.

